sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant B as BlastGuard
    participant SSH as ssh tunnel
    participant RO as readonly DB
    participant BC as becareful DB
    U->>B: ./bin/blastguard [-config f]
    B->>B: load + validate config
    B->>U: choose language (Enter = English)
    B->>B: TCP dial each connection's host:port (shared port checked once)
    alt a port is closed, tunnel.command is set and tunnel.auto_start (default true)
        B->>SSH: start child: ssh -L 6432:127.0.0.1:5432 apollogix_dev -N
        B->>B: poll port up to tunnel.wait (ssh output shown only on failure)
    else tunnel.auto_start: false
        B-->>U: log status only (port closed, tunnel not started)
    end
    B->>RO: connect, verify read-only
    alt readonly fails
        B-->>U: error, exit 1
    end
    B->>BC: connect (optional)
    alt becareful fails
        B-->>U: ALERT, continue readonly-only
    end
    B->>B: load cache, or scan schemas/tables via RO
    B->>U: open TUI (default_schema preselected)
